  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大事不妙啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59274E8B4E0D5999554AFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的车轮球正在路上乱跑！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176848F668F6E74036B6357288DEF4E0A4E718DD1FF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样下去……\n搞不好会撞到人和宝可梦啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E0B53BB20262026000A641E4E0D597D4F1A649E52304EBA548C5B9D53EF68A6554AFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托你！请和我的车轮球对战\n来让它停下吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584F60FF018BF7548C621176848F668F6E74035BF96218000A67658BA95B83505C4E0B5427FF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呣呣呜～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54635463545CFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呣呣。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5463546330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "帮大忙了！\n它终于肯停下了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E2E59275FD94E86FF01000A5B837EC84E8E80AF505C4E0B4E863002001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你居然让车轮球在街上乱跑，\n到底想做什么！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C4571368BA98F668F6E7403572888574E0A4E718DD1FF0C000A52305E9560F3505A4EC04E48FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好像惹人生气了啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D50CF60F94EBA751F6C144E86554A3002001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里是正义社，我们的目标是\n与野生宝可梦共生，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n废除野生特区。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC662F6B634E49793EFF0C62114EEC768476EE6807662F000A4E0E91CE751F5B9D53EF68A65171751FFF0C00100001BE00000A5E9F966491CE751F7279533A300200100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是打算让车轮球在街上乱跑\n来展现宝可梦的危险性，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n再借此来否定正义社吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F62537B978BA98F668F6E7403572888574E0A4E718DD1000A67655C5573B05B9D53EF68A67684537196696027FF0C00100001BE00000A518D501F6B64676554265B9A6B634E49793E5417FF1F00100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是的！\n不是的！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F7684FF01000A4E0D662F7684FF01FF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是车轮球它突然开始\n狂转起来，到处乱跑。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8F668F6E74035B837A8171365F0059CB000A72C28F6C8D776765FF0C523059044E718DD13002001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我一丁点都没想过\n要否定正义社！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E004E0170B990FD6CA160F38FC7000A898154265B9A6B634E49793EFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即便你没有那个打算，\n如果宝可梦做了危险的事情就会带来麻烦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734FBF4F606CA1670990A34E2A62537B97FF0C000A5982679C5B9D53EF68A6505A4E865371966976844E8B60C55C314F1A5E2667659EBB70E6FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就让我来好好教教你\n正义社的厉害之处吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318BA962116765597D597D655965594F60000A6B634E49793E768453895BB34E4B59045427FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃……教教我……？\n我既怕疼又怕恐怖的东西，不要啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54432026202665596559621120262026FF1F000A621165E2601575BC53C860156050601676844E1C897FFF0C4E0D8981554A20262026001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "首先你应当加深对宝可梦的了解！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "999651484F605E945F5352A06DF15BF95B9D53EF68A676844E8689E3FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "车轮球其实攻击性很强，\n有一点风吹草动就会高速旋转来使出撞击。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F668F6E740351765B9E653B51FB60275F885F3AFF0C000A67094E0070B998CE5439834952A85C314F1A9AD8901F65CB8F6C67654F7F51FA649E51FB300200100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要登峰级别够高，\n宝可梦就会听从训练家的指示，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但如果级别不够高的话……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981767B5CF07EA7522B591F9AD8FF0C000A5B9D53EF68A65C314F1A542C4ECE8BAD7EC35BB676846307793AFF0C00100001BE00000A4F465982679C7EA7522B4E0D591F9AD876848BDD2026202600100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了能靠自己的实力阻止车轮球，\n你应该来正义社锻炼自己！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我要说的就是这些！失陪。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8680FD976081EA5DF176845B9E529B963B6B628F668F6E7403FF0C000A4F605E948BE567656B634E49793E953B70BC81EA5DF1FF0100100001BE00000A621189818BF476845C31662F8FD94E9BFF015931966A300200100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好、好的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D3001597D7684FF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……也就是说我应该到\n那位皙白先生的门下去修行吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620264E5F5C31662F8BF462115E948BE55230000A90A34F4D7699767D5148751F768495E84E0B53BB4FEE884C5417FF1F001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～\n那样也很让人头疼啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5E000A90A368374E5F5F888BA94EBA593475BC554AFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要想和搭档宝可梦顺利合作下去，\n我自己作为训练家也必须<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n得有所成长才行啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898160F3548C642D68635B9D53EF68A6987A522954084F5C4E0B53BBFF0C000A621181EA5DF14F5C4E3A8BAD7EC35BB64E5F5FC5987B00100001BE00000A5F97670962406210957F624D884C554A3002001000020114017A0000",
